! QED arm: OFF -- the published benchmark convention.
!
! Deliberately empty of settings.  The base card already switches all four
! QED shower flags off, and restating them here would be a second copy of the
! same rule; this file exists so that `--qed off` is spelled the same way as
! the other arms and produces a directory that can be compared with them
! under identical bookkeeping.
!
! This arm MUST reproduce the published sample event for event.
